OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs 'landmark' EU deal
OL,4,Acould make next decade 'much better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister will tell Parliament
OL,7,Fon Monday the "landmark" deal struck
OL,8,Fwith the EU means there is a "very real
OL,9,Fprospect" the next decade can be "much
OL,10,Fbetter" than the last one.
OL,12,FThe deal is a "choice between a broken
OL,13,Fstatus quo or change", Andy Burnham
OL,14,Fwill tell MPs.
OL,16,FHe will also call it "the single
OL,17,Fbiggest growth measure to be delivered
OL,18,Fin this parliament" - repeating his
OL,19,Fclaim it could add #17bn to the British
OL,20,Feconomy.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
