OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs 'landmark' EU deal
OL,4,Acould make next decade 'much better'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe PM described it on Friday as a
OL,7,F"win-win" deal with the EU on British
OL,8,Ffood exports, emissions trading and a
OL,9,Fyouth experience scheme. But since then
OL,10,Fa host of politicians have criticised
OL,11,Fthe plan, with one former prime
OL,12,Fminister urging him to "move on" from
OL,13,FBrexit.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
