OL,3,ARussia-bound ship towed away after it
OL,4,Awas attacked in Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinland's Border Guard said on Sunday
OL,7,Fafternoon that fire was no longer
OL,8,Fvisible from the outside but thermal
OL,9,Fcameras showed that some containers on
OL,10,Fthe ship were still warm.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
